From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Kan Zhu <kanzhu@cs.washington.edu>
Date: Wed, 2 Sep 2026 07:38:15 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] fix(serving): stabilize multi-tokenizer streaming

Default ordinary HTTP serving to four tokenizer workers while preserving explicit single-worker restrictions for offline Engine, auth, SSL refresh, native gRPC, and elastic EP.

Separate prompt and generated token-ID response controls; derive alignment first/last-token timestamps from token-bearing output batches; preserve alignment logging inside Uvicorn tokenizer workers.

Cover W4 defaults, isolation boundaries, and streaming evidence with unit tests.
